Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] boundary baseline: board_read imports
 UNREAD_EVENT_KINDS

board_read._unmarked_event_marks reads the canonical heartbeat kind list from
kanban_activity_revision (the same tuple its trigger excludes), so the P2 cursor
and the dashboard can't drift. Register the intended crossing.
---
 scripts/boundary_lint_baseline.json | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/scripts/boundary_lint_baseline.json b/scripts/boundary_lint_baseline.json
index ebada0c22a..5bae6a3d7c 100644
--- a/scripts/boundary_lint_baseline.json
+++ b/scripts/boundary_lint_baseline.json
@@ -179,6 +179,7 @@
     "plugins/kanban/dashboard/board_diagnostics.py hermes_cli.kanban_diagnostics": 1,
     "plugins/kanban/dashboard/board_incremental.py hermes_cli.kanban_db": 1,
     "plugins/kanban/dashboard/board_prewarm.py hermes_cli.kanban_db": 1,
+    "plugins/kanban/dashboard/board_read.py hermes_cli.kanban_activity_revision.UNREAD_EVENT_KINDS": 1,
     "plugins/kanban/dashboard/board_read.py hermes_cli.kanban_db": 1,
     "plugins/kanban/dashboard/board_read.py hermes_cli.kanban_diagnostics": 1,
     "plugins/kanban/dashboard/board_read.py hermes_cli.kanban_wake_check": 1,
